flowchart LR
  Browser[Employee browser] -->|Email and password| Login[Local account boundary]
  Login --> Argon[Argon2id verification]
  Argon --> Session[(Hashed revocable session)]
  Browser -->|HttpOnly cookie| API[FastAPI and server RBAC]
  IdP[Future enterprise OIDC IdP] -. verified subject .-> API
  API --> Retrieval[Authorized retrieval]
  Retrieval --> Port[Application ModelProvider port]
  Port --> Deterministic[Deterministic CI provider]
  Port -. explicit configuration .-> Bedrock[Amazon Bedrock Converse adapter]
  Bedrock --> Validation[Schema citation and safety validation]
  Deterministic --> Validation
  Validation --> Human[Authorized human review]
